00:05:04.371 --> 00:05:07.908 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tout, vas-y tout, prends tout!

00:05:05.572 --> 00:05:09.142 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Tu n'as qu'une vie :

00:05:06.807 --> 00:05:10.377 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vis-la, prends-là! C'est quoi

00:05:08.008 --> 00:05:11.611 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que j'ai lu hier? C'est Salomé

00:05:09.243 --> 00:05:12.813 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui disait... Attends...

00:05:10.477 --> 00:05:14.047 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La vie ne fais pas de cadeaux.

00:05:11.712 --> 00:05:25.525 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Si tu la veux, vol

00:05:12.913 --> 00:05:27.060 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'est beau, hein? Lou Salomé.

00:05:14.147 --> 00:05:28.562 size:53% position:73% line:53%
J'ai lu ça hier.

00:05:25.625 --> 00:05:31.031 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Merci d'avoir volé un peu

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:32.232 size:53% position:73% line:53%
